      "id": 3,
      "claim": "If successful interrogations can be achieved without torture, then torture is not a required condition for successful interrogation.",
      "evidence": "Logical implication: (¬torture → success) demonstrated by Soufan’s testimony combined with (torture → failure) means success does not depend on torture.",
